       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TRELCLN.
       AUTHOR.        CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  JANUARY 1996.
       INSTALLATION.  THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.

      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T R E L C L N                                            *
      *                                                            *
      *   THIS PROGRAM DELETES OLD RECORDS FROM THE SHIPPING       *
      *   RELEASE AUDIT FILE (MCFPCS6100).  THE AMOUNT OF TIME A   *
      *   RECORD IS KEPT IS CONTAINED IN THE PODL KEY OF MPLTINFO. *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DRELTRAK-IO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS6101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DRELTRAK-IO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRELTRAK-REC-IO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS6101.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

      **************************************************************
      **      S W I T C H E S  &  H O L D   A R E A S             **
      **************************************************************

       01  DRELTRAK-EOF-SW           PIC X    VALUE "N".

       01  CURRENT-DATE.
           10  CUR-YY                PIC XX.
           10  CUR-MM                PIC XX.
           10  CUR-DD                PIC XX.

       01  DELETE-DATE.
           05  DEL-CC                PIC XX.
           05  DEL-YY                PIC XX.
           05  DEL-MM                PIC XX.
           05  FILLER                PIC XX  VALUE "01".

       01  HOLD-MM                   PIC S99.
       01  HOLD-YEAR.
           05  HOLD-CC               PIC 99.
           05  HOLD-YY               PIC 99.

       01  NUM-MONTHS                PIC 99.

       01  RECS-DEL                  PIC 9(6)  VALUE 0.

      **************************************************************
      **          D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                 **
      **************************************************************

       COPY DRELTRAK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLT0    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLTPODL IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **         P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N              **
      **************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           IF DRELTRAK-EOF-SW = "N"
               PERFORM 6-MAIN UNTIL (DRELTRAK-EOF-SW = "Y").
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O                 DRELTRAK-IO
                INPUT               MPLTINFO-I.
           PERFORM 999-READ-MPLTINFO.

      *------- CALCULATE CUTOFF DATE FOR DELETE.
           ACCEPT CURRENT-DATE      FROM DATE.
           MOVE CUR-MM              TO  HOLD-MM.
           MOVE CUR-YY              TO  HOLD-YY.
           IF CUR-YY > "90"
               MOVE "19"            TO  HOLD-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"            TO  HOLD-CC.
           SUBTRACT NUM-MONTHS      FROM HOLD-MM.
           PERFORM UNTIL HOLD-MM > 0
               ADD 12               TO  HOLD-MM
               SUBTRACT 1           FROM HOLD-YY
           END-PERFORM.
           MOVE HOLD-MM             TO  DEL-MM.
           MOVE HOLD-CC             TO  DEL-CC.
           MOVE HOLD-YY             TO  DEL-YY.

           PERFORM 999-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.

       2-EOJ.
           DISPLAY "** NUMBER OF RECORDS DELETED:  " RECS-DEL.
           CLOSE                    DRELTRAK-IO
                                    MPLTINFO-I.

       6-MAIN.
           IF TREL-DATE-STAMP < DELETE-DATE
               PERFORM 60-DELETE-RECORD.

           PERFORM 999-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.

       60-DELETE-RECORD.
           DELETE DRELTRAK-IO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DELETE DRELTRAK ERROR IN 60-DELETE"
                                    TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.
           ADD 1                    TO  RECS-DEL.

      ************************************************************
      **                 F I L E   R E A D S                    **
      ************************************************************

       999-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PODL"       TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2" OR MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH NOT NUMERIC
                                  OR MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH = 0
               MOVE 6                  TO NUM-MONTHS
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 999-READ-MPLTINFO"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "PODL"             TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH  TO  NUM-MONTHS.

       999-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK.
           READ DRELTRAK-IO NEXT INTO BUF-DRELTRAK
               AT END MOVE "Y"      TO  DRELTRAK-EOF-SW.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" AND DRELTRAK-EOF-SW = "N"
               MOVE "READ DRELTRAK ERROR IN 999-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STATUS        TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

       999-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

